    "description": {
      "value": "Murrou crafted these feathers to assist in remembering information. A mnemonic feather is an emu feather imbued with magical energies. You can place the mnemonic feather in a book with an Interact action. As long as the mnemonic feather remains within the book, you recall information contained within that book perfectly, as if you were reading the page, as long as the book is on the same plane as you. When you attempt to Recall Knowledge about a topic contained within the book, you gain a +1 status bonus to the check. You mentally impart the book's knowledge to your ally, giving them the benefit of the mnemonic feather."
    },
